{"seq":3,"slug":"concentration-entry-barriers","title":"市场集中度与进入壁垒","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/industrial-organization/market-structure/concentration-entry-barriers","wordCount":1982,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"市场集中度与进入壁垒\">市场集中度与进入壁垒</h1><p>反垄断机构每天都要回答一个看似简单的问题：这两家公司合并后，市场会不会变得太集中？「太集中」需要一个能写进法律文件、能在法庭上辩论的数字，而不是直觉。与此配套的另一个问题是：如果一个市场真的高度集中、利润丰厚，为什么没有新厂商蜂拥而入把利润竞争掉？答案藏在进入壁垒里。这两个概念——集中度的测量与进入的阻碍——共同决定了一个市场的竞争能否持续，也是把前两节的定性讨论变成执法可用工具的关键一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>集中度与壁垒是市场结构的两个量化支柱，再加上「结构如何影响行为、行为如何影响绩效」的传导逻辑，构成了产业组织最古老的分析范式 SCP（结构—行为—绩效）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[市场结构 Structure] --&gt; B[企业行为 Conduct]&#10;  B --&gt; C[市场绩效 Performance]&#10;  A --&gt; D[集中度&lt;br/&gt;HHI 与 CRn]&#10;  A --&gt; E[进入壁垒&lt;br/&gt;结构性与策略性]&#10;  D --&gt; F[少数厂商&lt;br/&gt;协调更易]&#10;  E --&gt; G[高利润不被&lt;br/&gt;新进入磨平]&#10;  C --&gt; H[价格 利润&lt;br/&gt;创新 效率]\">flowchart TD\n  A[市场结构 Structure] --&gt; B[企业行为 Conduct]\n  B --&gt; C[市场绩效 Performance]\n  A --&gt; D[集中度&lt;br/&gt;HHI 与 CRn]\n  A --&gt; E[进入壁垒&lt;br/&gt;结构性与策略性]\n  D --&gt; F[少数厂商&lt;br/&gt;协调更易]\n  E --&gt; G[高利润不被&lt;br/&gt;新进入磨平]\n  C --&gt; H[价格 利润&lt;br/&gt;创新 效率]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>测量或类型</th>\n<th>高值含义</th>\n<th>政策关联</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CRn 集中度</td>\n<td>前 n 家份额之和</td>\n<td>越高越集中</td>\n<td>直观但忽略分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HHI</td>\n<td>份额平方和</td>\n<td>越高越集中</td>\n<td>并购审查门槛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构性壁垒</td>\n<td>规模经济、成本优势</td>\n<td>进入更难</td>\n<td>中性，未必反竞争</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略性壁垒</td>\n<td>在位者主动设置</td>\n<td>进入更难</td>\n<td>可能违法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>SCP 范式提醒我们：集中度本身不是目的，它之所以重要，是因为它会改变企业行为（更易协调抬价）进而恶化绩效（高价、低创新）。但后来的芝加哥学派反驳说，高集中度也可能只是高效率企业胜出的结果——同一个数字可以有两种相反解读，这正是反垄断争论的核心张力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"crn-最直观的集中度指标\">CRn：最直观的集中度指标</h2><p>最早被广泛使用的集中度度量是 n 厂商集中率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CR_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，即市场前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 大企业的份额之和。常用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CR_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（前四家）：若四家合计占 80%，市场显然高度集中；若只占 20%，则相当分散。它的优点是计算简单、数据易得，监管报告和行业研究中至今常见。</p>\n<p>但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CR_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 有个致命盲区：它对前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 家之间的份额分布完全无感。一个由四家各占 20% 的市场和一个由一家占 65%、另三家各占约 5% 的市场，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CR_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 同为 80%，但前者是势均力敌的寡头、后者是接近垄断的格局，竞争含义天差地别。这个缺陷直接催生了对分布敏感的 HHI。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hhi-平方放大龙头\">HHI：平方放大龙头</h2><p>赫芬达尔—赫希曼指数（HHI）把每家企业的百分比份额平方后求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HHI = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} s_i^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 家的市场份额（按百分点计，0 到 100）。平方运算让大企业的权重被放大——65 平方是 4225，而 5 平方只有 25——于是 HHI 天然对「一家独大」敏感，恰好补上了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CR_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的盲区。完全垄断时一家占 100%，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>100</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HHI = 100^2 = 10000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10000</span></span></span></span></span>（理论最大值）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 家均分时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HHI = 10000/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10000/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，企业越多越接近 0。</p>\n<p>美国司法部与联邦贸易委员会 2023 年合并发布、并沿用至 2026 年的《并购指南》以 HHI 划线：合并后 HHI 超过 1800 且变动超过 100 的交易，被推定具有显著增强市场势力之虞，将受到严格审查。HHI 因此从学术指标变成了直接决定一笔并购能否过关的法律阈值。它与上一节寡头加价公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{L} = HHI/|\\varepsilon_d|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\">/∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 的联系（见 <a href=\"oligopoly-market-power\">寡头与市场势力</a>），正是它被监管者青睐的理论根基——HHI 不只是描述集中，它预测加价。指南的完整执法框架见 <a href=\"../policy-frontiers/antitrust-policy-enforcement\">反垄断政策与执法</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"进入壁垒-为什么利润不被磨平\">进入壁垒：为什么利润不被磨平</h2><p>完全竞争假设进入完全自由，正利润会被新进入者迅速竞争掉。现实中高集中、高利润的市场却能长期存在，原因是进入壁垒——阻止潜在竞争者进入的各种因素。贝恩与斯蒂格勒对「什么算壁垒」有经典争论：贝恩看进入者面对的任何劣势，斯蒂格勒则只把「在位者当年也付过、但新进入者额外要付」的成本算作真壁垒。</p>\n<p>壁垒大致分两类。结构性壁垒源于行业技术与成本本身：规模经济（最小有效规模很大，新进入者一上来就得巨额投资才能不亏，如芯片代工）、绝对成本优势（在位者掌握专利、关键资源或学习曲线积累）、必要的沉没成本（退出时收不回的投入，提高了进入的风险）。这类壁垒往往是中性的，甚至意味着大规模生产更有效率。</p>\n<p>策略性壁垒则是在位者为阻挡进入而主动设置的：维持过剩产能以威慑、用掠夺性低价惩罚进入者、抢注专利或锁定渠道。这类行为可能构成反竞争，是反垄断关注的重点。在位者如何让这些威胁变得可信，是动态博弈的核心，留给 <a href=\"../strategy-games/entry-deterrence-commitment\">进入威慑与承诺</a> 专门展开；网络效应作为数字时代最强的一类壁垒，则见 <a href=\"../strategy-games/network-effects-platforms\">网络效应与平台竞争</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>壁垒类型</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>反竞争嫌疑</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规模经济</td>\n<td>技术与成本</td>\n<td>芯片代工、电信网络</td>\n<td>低（中性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绝对成本优势</td>\n<td>专利、资源、经验</td>\n<td>制药专利、矿权</td>\n<td>低到中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沉没成本</td>\n<td>不可回收投入</td>\n<td>重资产制造</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过剩产能威慑</td>\n<td>在位者策略</td>\n<td>提前扩产吓阻</td>\n<td>中到高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>掠夺性定价</td>\n<td>在位者策略</td>\n<td>短期亏本驱逐对手</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络效应</td>\n<td>用户规模</td>\n<td>社交平台、操作系统</td>\n<td>中到高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"可竞争市场-壁垒为零的理想\">可竞争市场：壁垒为零的理想</h2><p>鲍莫尔等人提出的可竞争市场理论给了一个发人深省的反例：即便市场上只有一家企业，只要进入和退出完全无壁垒、沉没成本为零，潜在进入者的「打了就跑」威胁就足以迫使在位者把价格压到竞争水平、利润归零。换言之，重要的不是市场里现在有几家，而是进出有多自由。</p>\n<p>这个理论的政策含义极强：监管的重点或许不该是直接控制集中度，而是拆除进入壁垒、降低沉没成本，让市场自带纪律。它也解释了为什么航空（飞机可调往别处，沉没成本相对低）一度被视为接近可竞争。当然纯粹的可竞争市场和完全竞争一样是理想标本，现实中沉没成本几乎无处不在，但它把「壁垒高度」而非「企业数量」推到了竞争分析的中心，深刻影响了放松规制的思路（见 <a href=\"../policy-frontiers/regulation-deregulation\">规制与放松规制</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>市场集中度用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CR_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（前 n 家份额和）和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HHI = \\sum s_i^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0728em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 度量；HHI 通过平方放大龙头，对「一家独大」更敏感，弥补了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CR_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 忽略分布的缺陷。</li>\n<li>美国 2023 年《并购指南》（沿用至 2026）以合并后 HHI 超 1800 且变动超 100 作为严格审查的推定门槛。</li>\n<li>进入壁垒解释了高利润为何不被新进入磨平，分结构性（规模经济、成本优势、沉没成本）与策略性（产能威慑、掠夺定价）两类，后者是反垄断关注重点。</li>\n<li>SCP 范式把结构、行为、绩效串成因果链，但芝加哥学派指出高集中也可能源于高效率，同一数字有两种解读。</li>\n<li>可竞争市场理论强调真正的纪律来自进入自由而非企业数量，把壁垒高度推到竞争分析中心。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"市场集中度与进入壁垒","id":"市场集中度与进入壁垒"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CRn：最直观的集中度指标","id":"crn-最直观的集中度指标"},{"level":2,"text":"HHI：平方放大龙头","id":"hhi-平方放大龙头"},{"level":2,"text":"进入壁垒：为什么利润不被磨平","id":"进入壁垒-为什么利润不被磨平"},{"level":2,"text":"可竞争市场：壁垒为零的理想","id":"可竞争市场-壁垒为零的理想"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"寡头与市场势力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/industrial-organization/market-structure/oligopoly-market-power"},"next":{"title":"定价策略与价格歧视","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/industrial-organization/firm-conduct/pricing-and-price-discrimination"}}